  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de mejoramiento de la conectividad rural</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Connectivity Improvement Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es mejorar la competitividad del sector agropecuario y el desarrollo econmico y social de la poblacin rural. El objetivo especfico es mejorar la calidad de la infraestructura vial de la red de caminos vecinales intervenida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to enhance competitiveness in the agricultural sector and improve economic and social development in the rural population. The specific objective is to improve the quality of road infrastructure in the network of rural access roads targeted by the project.</narrative>
  </description>
